    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### **Predict & Trace**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Look at the JavaScript code in `script.js`. In the box below, write what you think will happen when you click the **Switch to Dark Mode** button.\r\n\r\n2. Click the **Switch to Dark Mode** button. Did the result match your prediction?\r\n\r\n3. Use AI Tutor to help you review the code.",
